It resolves RFC 9421 signature keyids (did:key, did:web, and HTTPS key
sources) to raw Ed25519 public keys, with an SSRF-guarded resolver, and
provides the inverse key-publication helpers. Companion to the
algovoi-rfc9421-verifier and algovoi-rfc9421-signer packages.

